COMMENTS OF NATURAL RESOURCES DEFENSE COUNCIL  
Pursuant to Rule 211 of the Rules of Practice and Procedure of the Federal Energy 
Regulatory Commission (“the Commission” or “FERC”),1 the Natural Resources Defense 
Council (“NRDC”) respectfully submits these Comments in response to the Commission’s 
February 20, 2025 order2 and PJM’s March 24, 2025 Answer.3 



1 18 C.F.R. §§ 385.211. 
2 Order Instituting Proceeding Under Section 206 of the Federal Power Act and Consolidating with Other 
Proceedings, 190 FERC ¶ 61,115 (2025), (“Order”). 
3 Answer of PJM Interconnection, L.L.C., Docket Nos. ER25-712-000 et. al., (March 24, 2025), Accession No. 
20250324-5313, (“PJM Answer”).
